<title>USA: Sunglass Hut Nov same-store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Sunglass Hut Nov same-store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$28.1	$25.2	11.8	 -9.9</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $430.3     $332.1	29.5	  3.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage. Same-store sales adjusted for Thanksgiving holiday fell 3.4 percent.</p>
<p>Period ending November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Sunglass Hut International.</p>
</text>
